	(text "If this motor-connector get\nplugged or un-plugged,\nwhile VMS(VMC) is powered,\nSTM32 will die.\n\nIn 3 of 4 cases, GPIOs\nCUR_SENSE and BRK_LVTTL\nhave abnormal low resistance\n(0.9-2.4 Ohm) after RIP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 249.682 83.82 0)
		(effects
